      "content": "that's a good start, really solid analysis on the quiet luxury shift. \n\ncan u expand on this? i need it to be longer, maybe 3-4 paragraphs. try to dive deeper into how specific brands are reacting to these shifts—like, how Prada or Chanel are handling the tension between heritage and the new sustainability demands. \n\nalso, just a reminder, the SEO score is looking a bit low on this first draft. i don't want you to keyword stuff or make it look fake, but it definitely needs more of those brand names integrated into the actual discussion of the trends to hit our discovery targets.",
